hadiths[15]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1052","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Jurf mein hote hue do parindon ko pathar mara aur unhein lagaya, phir aik to mar gaya aur Abdullah bin Umar ne use phenk diya, aur dusre ki taraf Abdullah bin Umar kulhadi lekar use zibah karne gae aur wo zibah karne se pehle mar gaya to Abdullah ne use bhi phenk diya."
"1053","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Qasim bin Muhammad use makrooh samajhte they jise muarraz aur gulel ne qatal kya ho."
"1054","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Abi Sasaa se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Amr bin Jamuh aur Abdullah bin Amr Ansari phir Salmi, sailaab ne un dono ki qabr khod di thi aur un dono ki qabr us taraf thi jo sailaab ki taraf hai, aur wo dono aik hi qabr mein they, aur wo un mein se they jo Uhud ke din shaheed hue, phir un dono se khoda gaya taake unhein un ki jagah se badla jaye, to wo dono aise pae gae ke na badle they goya wo kal mare they, aur un mein se aik zakhmi hua tha aur us ne apna haath apne zakhm par rakha tha aur use isi tarah dafn kya gaya tha, to us ka haath us ke zakhm se hataya gaya phir chhora gaya to waisa hi laut aaya jaisa tha, aur Uhud aur us din ke darmiyan jis din un dono se khoda gaya chhiyalis saal they. Malik ne kaha ke zaroorat se do ya teen mardon ko aik hi qabr mein dafn karne mein koi harj nahi, aur bade ko us taraf rakha jaye jo qible ki taraf hai."
"1055","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke wo sikhaye hue kutte ke bare mein kehte they ke jo wo tumhare liye roke use kha lo, chahe us ne qatal kya ho aur chahe qatal na kya ho."
"1056","Mujhe Malik se, us se jis ne Nafi ko kehte suna riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke chahe us ne khaya ho aur chahe na khaya ho."
"1057","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se, unhon ne apni phuphi se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein apni dadi se bayan kya ke unhon ne apne uper Masjid Quba tak paidal chalne ki mannat mani thi, phir wo mar gain aur use poora na kar sakin, to Abdullah bin Abbas ne un ki beti ko fatwa diya ke un ki taraf se paidal chale. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke koi kisi ki taraf se paidal na chale."
"1058","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdur Rahman bin Abi Huraira ne Abdullah bin Umar se us ke bare mein pucha jo samandar phenke to unhon ne use us ke khane se mana kya. Nafi ne kaha ke phir Abdullah laute aur mushaf mangwaya aur padha ke tumhare liye samandar ka shikaar aur us ka khana halal kya gaya. Nafi ne kaha ke Abdullah bin Umar ne mujhe Abdur Rahman bin Abi Huraira ke paas bheja ke is ke khane mein koi harj nahi."
"1059","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Saad Jari Umar bin Khattab ke azad karda se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Abdullah bin Umar se machhliyon ke bare mein pucha jo baaz baaz ko qatal karti hain ya thand se marti hain, to unhon ne kaha ke is mein koi harj nahi. Saad ne kaha ke phir maine Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas se pucha to unhon ne isi tarah kaha."
"1060","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Abu Salma bin Abdur Rahman se riwayat kya ke Abu Huraira aur Zaid bin Sabit us mein koi harj na samajhte they jo samandar phenke."
"1061","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Abu Salma bin Abdur Rahman se riwayat kya ke Jaar ke rehne walon mein se kuchh log aae aur Marwan bin Hakam se us ke bare mein pucha jo samandar phenke, to unhon ne kaha ke is mein koi harj nahi, aur kaha ke Zaid bin Sabit aur Abu Huraira ke paas jao aur un se is ke bare mein puchho phir mere paas aao aur mujhe khabar do ke wo dono kya kehte hain, phir wo dono un ke paas aae aur un se pucha to dono ne kaha ke is mein koi harj nahi. Phir wo Marwan ke paas aae aur unhein khabar di. To Marwan ne kaha ke maine tum se kaha tha. Malik ne kaha ke machhliyon ke khane mein koi harj nahi jinhein majoosi shikaar kare kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne samandar ke bare mein kaha ke us ka pani paak karne wala hai aur us ka murdaar halal hai. Malik ne kaha ke jab use murdaar khaya jaye to use nuqsan nahi ke use kis ne shikaar kya."
"1062","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Abu Idris Khaulani se, unhon ne Abu Salaba Khushani se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke darindon mein se har daant wale ka khana haram hai."
"1063","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ismail bin Abi Hakeem se, unhon ne Ubaida bin Sufyan Hazrami se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke darindon mein se har daant wale ka khana haram hai."
"1064","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utba bin Masud se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abbas se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik murdaar bakri ke paas se guzre jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Maimuna ki azad karda ko di gai thi, to farmaya ke tum ne is ki khaal se faida kyun na uthaya. To unhon ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah ye murdaar hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke sirf us ka khana haram kya gaya hai."
"1065","Mujhe Malik ne, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Ibn Wala Misri se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abbas se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab khaal dabaghat di jaye to paak ho gai."
"1066","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yazid bin Abdullah bin Qusait se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman bin Sauban se, unhon ne apni walida se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aisha se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke murdaar ki khaalon se faida uthaya jaye jab dabaghat di jain."
